      "moduleId": "ModuleDescText",
      "properties": {
        "fontSize": "14px",
        "descriptionText": "<p style=\"line-height: 2; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 16px;\">NEWSLETTER&nbsp;VOL.12</strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 2; margin: 0; padding: 0; min-height: 1.5em; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 2; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\"><strong style=\"color: #e94c09;\">Law&nbsp;Expo&nbsp;Seoul&nbsp;2026&nbsp;(법률&nbsp;산업&nbsp;박람회)</strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 2; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\"><strong>📆&nbsp;기&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;간</strong>&nbsp;:&nbsp;6월&nbsp;24일(수)&nbsp;–&nbsp;26일(금),&nbsp;3일간</p><p style=\"line-height: 2; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\"><strong>🚩&nbsp;장&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;소</strong>&nbsp;:&nbsp;양재&nbsp;aT센터&nbsp;제2전시장</p><p style=\"line-height: 2; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\"><strong>✅&nbsp;주&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;관</strong>&nbsp;:&nbsp;㈜법률신문사,&nbsp;(사)인하우스카운슬포럼,&nbsp;㈜메쎄이상</p><p style=\"line-height: 2; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\"><strong>📍&nbsp;후&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;원</strong>&nbsp;:&nbsp;개인정보전문가협회,&nbsp;대한공증인협회,&nbsp;대한법률구조공단,&nbsp;대한법무사협회,&nbsp;대한상사중재원,&nbsp;법학전문대학원협의회,&nbsp;전국정보보호정책협의회,&nbsp;한국공인노무사회,&nbsp;한국법학교수회,&nbsp;한국인공지능법학회,&nbsp;한국정보법학회,&nbsp;한국형사법무정책연구원</p><p style=\"line-height: 2; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\"><strong>📋&nbsp;컨퍼런스</strong>&nbsp;:&nbsp;Legal&nbsp;AX&nbsp;Summit,&nbsp;기업&nbsp;리스크&nbsp;관리&nbsp;컨퍼런스,&nbsp;커리어&nbsp;컨퍼런스,&nbsp;협단체&nbsp;전문&nbsp;세미나</p><p style=\"line-height: 2; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\"><strong>📢&nbsp;부대행사</strong>&nbsp;:&nbsp;리걸&nbsp;커넥트(네트워킹&nbsp;나잇),&nbsp;무료&nbsp;법률&nbsp;상담&nbsp;이벤트,&nbsp;커리어&amp;채용&nbsp;컨설팅,&nbsp;멘토링&nbsp;네트워킹&nbsp;런치,&nbsp;로스쿨&nbsp;AI&nbsp;챌린지</p><p style=\"line-height: 2; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: break-all;\"><strong>💡&nbsp;특별관&nbsp;</strong>:&nbsp;리걸테크&nbsp;AX&nbsp;특별관</p>",
