    {
      "moduleId": "Module01-2",
      "properties": {
        "contentText": "<p style=\"word-break: break-all; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--point-color-2, #e94c09);\">• 무료법률상담</strong> 24(수) – 26(금), 10:30 – 16:00</p><p style=\"word-break: break-all; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">기업상담부터 일반 민사·형사·가사 상담까지 1:1 무료 법률 상담 이벤트</p><p style=\"word-break: break-all; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; word-break: break-all; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--point-color-2, #e94c09);\">• 커리어 컨설팅</strong> 24(수) – 26(금), 10:00 – 17:00</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; word-break: break-all; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">법조계 전반의 최신 채용 공고를 바탕으로 커리어 도약을 위한 맞춤 전략을 컨설팅 받을 수 있는 기회</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; word-break: break-all; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; word-break: break-all; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--point-color-2, #e94c09);\">• 큐레이션 투어</strong> 24(수) – 26(금)</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.7; word-break: break-all; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">[코스 1] 13:30 – 14:30 법조인을 위한 리걸테크 투어</p><p style=\"word-break: keep-all; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; padding: 0; word-wrap: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere;\">[코스 2] 15:00 – 15:40 기업 관계자(법무, 세무, 노무 등)를 위한 솔루션 투어</p>",
